#
# The build context of api/Dockerfile ONLY. BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile in place of the
# repository's .dockerignore, so this file is that one plus what the api
# image has no use for. It is separate rather than added to the root
# .dockerignore because the tests image builds from the same context and
# copies api/Dockerfile and reads the api's sources.
#
# embedded/build.sh excludes the same api files from the embedded tree; keep
# the two lists in step.

# ---- the repository's .dockerignore ----
**/node_modules
client/dist
coverage
tests/report
tests/node_modules
.git
.idea
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# ---- not needed at run time in the api image ----
# Repository files that sit in api/.
api/CLAUDE.md
api/Dockerfile
api/Dockerfile.dockerignore
api/.gitignore
api/example.json
# Runs the api outside a container; there is nothing for it to do inside one.
api/native.js
# ldapjs needs lib/, package.json and LICENSE. Its own test suites, docs,
# examples, build scripts and tool configuration stay out.
api/node-ldapjs/test
api/node-ldapjs/test-integration
api/node-ldapjs/docs
api/node-ldapjs/examples
api/node-ldapjs/scripts
api/node-ldapjs/.github
api/node-ldapjs/.git
api/node-ldapjs/docker-compose.yml
api/node-ldapjs/.eslintrc.js
api/node-ldapjs/.eslintignore
api/node-ldapjs/.taprc.yml
api/node-ldapjs/dt.png
api/node-ldapjs/CHANGES.md
api/node-ldapjs/README.md
api/node-ldapjs/.gitignore
